<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">offūcĭa</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		ob-fucus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a paint</i>, <i>wash</i> for the face
			(ante- and post-class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pigmentum ullum, neque cerussam Melinumve neque
					aliam ullam offuciam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Most. 1, 3, 107</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a trick</i>, <i>delusion</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut.
				Capt. 3, 4, 123</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">id praestigiarum atque offuciarum genus,</span>”
				<i>delusions</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					14, 1, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
